{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0013", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$F, G : \\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0002": "$t : F \\to G$", "MATH_0003": "$\\{t_x\\}_{x\\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{A})}$", "MATH_0004": "$t_x : F(x) \\to G(x)$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\phi : x \\to y$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nF(x) \\ar[r]^{t_x} \\ar[d]_{F(\\phi)} & G(x) \\ar[d]^{G(\\phi)} \\\\\nF(y) \\ar[r]^{t_y} & G(y) }\n$$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-transformation-functors}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:77e4266b8bd6441468961c0ec556bcd2d71b0e7f37a47da25c4cbdc9147d1a26", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:90b5f917990d6b5b045a53eca6528d2d1c483d3d6c5a78d1f078b18ccb91f738", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be functors.\nA <TEXTITOPEN_0001>natural transformation<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>, or a <TEXTITOPEN_0002>morphism of functors<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0002>, is a collection <MATH_0003>\nsuch that\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> is a morphism in the category <MATH_0005>, and\n<STRUCT_0003> for every morphism <MATH_0006> of <MATH_0007> the following\ndiagram is commutative\n<MATH_0008>\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a9017311a4845c8d3815162f09300b93f775da30a9eb2bf7424d28daf0e43eb6", "unit_id": "tag:001I:statement"}
